---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { PRICES, FOUNDING_SPOTS, FOUNDING_LOCK_MONTHS, FEATURED_CAP_PER_CATEGORY, FEATURED_CONTACT, mailto } from '../data/featured';
---
<Base title="For shops & show organizers" description="Run a Pokémon league, card shop or card show near Austin? Get listed on Card Night for free, or get a clearly labeled Featured spot.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Run a shop, league, or show near Austin?</h1>
    <p class="lede">Card Night helps Austin families find kid-friendly places to play and buy Pokémon cards. Basic listings are free. Featured spots are an optional, clearly labeled way to get seen first.</p>

    <h2>Free listing (always)</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Add your store, league night, or show, or correct an existing listing.</li>
      <li>Send us your current Pokémon schedule, entry fee, and whether younger kids are welcome.</li>
      <li>Free listings stay free. You never have to pay to be listed or to get a fix made.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><a class="btn ghost" href={mailto('Card Night listing')}>Email us about a free listing</a></p>

    <h2>Featured spots</h2>
    <p>Want families to see you first? A Featured spot puts your listing at the top and marks it <b>⭐ Featured · Sponsored</b>.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="price-grid">
    <div class="card founding">
      <span class="chip">First {FOUNDING_SPOTS} spots</span>
      <h3>Founding Featured</h3>
      <div class="price">${PRICES.founding}<small>/month</small></div>
      <p>Same as Featured, with the price locked for {FOUNDING_LOCK_MONTHS} months.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="chip">Monthly</span>
      <h3>Featured listing</h3>
      <div class="price">${PRICES.featured}<small>/month</small></div>
      <p>Runs 30 days at a time.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Pinned to the top of <a href="/places">/places</a> and your category</li>
        <li>A homepage slot in “Featured this week”</li>
        <li>⭐ Featured badge</li>
        <li>Direct link to your site or event page</li>
        <li>A callout in the weekly update</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <span class="chip">Fri–Sun</span>
      <h3>Weekend Show Boost</h3>
      <div class="price">${PRICES.boost}<small>/weekend</small></div>
      <p>Made for a card show, prerelease, or League Cup.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Pinned and badged Friday through Sunday</li>
        <li>Homepage slot that weekend</li>
        <li>Mention in that week’s update</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="prose">
    <p class="note"><b>Limited spots:</b> at most {FEATURED_CAP_PER_CATEGORY} Featured listings per category (Shops, Leagues, Shows) at any time, so Featured stays useful for families. Founding pricing is for the first {FOUNDING_SPOTS} spots only.</p>

    <h2>How to apply</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Email <a href={mailto()}>{FEATURED_CONTACT}</a> with the subject “Card Night Featured.”</li>
      <li>Tell us your shop, league, or show, which option you want, and your start date.</li>
      <li>We confirm a spot is open and send a simple invoice (Venmo, PayPal, or invoice). Your spot goes live once it's paid.</li>
    </ol>
    <p><a class="btn" href={mailto()}>Apply for a Featured spot</a></p>

    <h2>How we keep it honest</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Featured spots are paid placement and are always labeled “Sponsored.”</li>
      <li>Paying never changes our parent notes, times, or prices. We write them the same way for every listing.</li>
      <li>No fake reviews or ratings. We may decline a spot that isn't a good fit for families.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
